# PDFPixie Docker Ignore
# Minimal and safe exclusions

# Dependencies (installed during build)
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.uv-cache

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build

# Data directories
data
uploads
logs

# Lock files
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/uv.lock

# Git and IDE
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea

# Environment files
.env*

# Docker and docs
docker-compose*.yml
docker
docs

# Testing
coverage
.pytest_cache

# Temporary
tmp
temp
